[NewSubmission.Objectives]
Task: Repulse the attack of Soviet tanks and infantry.
[NewSubmission.Description]
On February 2, the Red Army began an operation to capture the regions of Kharkov and Belgorod, code-named "Star". The main enemy of the Soviet troops in this direction was the II SS Panzer Corps consisting of the Liebstandarte SS Adolf Hitler, Das Reich and Totenkopf.
On February 11, east of Kharkov, in the area of ​​the small village of Rogan, for a whole day, infantrymen of the 1st company of the 1st tank-grenadier regiment of the Liebstandarte SS Adolf Hitler division, supported by several assault guns and 20-mm anti-aircraft guns, repelled attacks by 15 tank corps of the Red Army.
[NewSubmission.Success]
[NewSubmission.Failed]
